{{!--
  entity.handlebars
  =================
  Renders a single entity section with attributes table and identifiers.

  Context: a LogicalEntity object (iterated from datamodel.entities)

  Available properties:
    id, name, description   – Identity
    attributes[]            – Array of LogicalEntityAttribute
      .id, .name            – Attribute identity
      .datatype             – e.g. "Integer", "Text", "Decimal"
      .length               – Text length constraint
      .precision, .scale    – Decimal precision
      .mandatory            – Boolean, required field
      .description          – Free-text description
      ._isPrimaryIdentifier – Computed: true if part of primary key
    identifiers[]           – Array of LogicalIdentifier
      .primary              – Boolean
      .attributes[]         – Attributes in this identifier
    inherits[]              – Parent entities (inheritance)
--}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>

{{#if description}}
> {{description}}

{{/if}}
{{#each inherits}}{{#if @first}}> **Inherits from:** {{/if}}[{{name}}](#{{id}}){{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{#if @last}}

{{/if}}{{/each}}
| | Attribute | Datatype | PK | Mandatory | Description |
|--:|:----------|:---------|:--:|:---------:|:------------|
{{#each attributes}}
| {{@index}} | {{#if _isPrimaryIdentifier}}**{{name}}**{{else}}{{name}}{{/if}} | `{{datatype}}`{{#if length}}({{length}}){{/if}}{{#if precision}}({{precision}}{{#if scale}},{{scale}}{{/if}}){{/if}} | {{#if _isPrimaryIdentifier}}🔑{{/if}} | {{#if mandatory}}✔{{/if}} | {{#if description}}*{{description}}*{{/if}} |
{{/each}}

{{#each identifiers}}{{#if primary}}
> 🔑 **Primary Key** — {{#each attributes}}**{{name}}**{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}
{{/if}}{{/each}}

---

